/* 插件设置窗口 */
"Let this plugin run" = "让这个插件运行";
"It runs for as long as Polter does and is handed those events as they happen. A plugin that stops, or cannot reach where it writes, catches up afterwards rather than losing anything -- Polter's own record on disk is what it is copied from and stays the record either way. Changing this takes effect the next time Polter starts." = "它跟 Polter 一起运行，事件发生时就交给它。插件停了、或者写不进它要写的地方，事后会补上，不会丢东西 —— 抄的是 Polter 自己在磁盘上的记录，那份记录无论如何都在。改这一项要下次 Polter 启动才生效。";
"What it is handed: %@" = "交给它的是：%@";
"This plugin subscribes to nothing, so Polter has nothing to hand it and will not start it." = "这个插件什么都没订阅，Polter 没有东西交给它，也不会启动它。";
"This plugin has nothing to configure." = "此插件没有需要配置的项。";
"A value may be a reference instead of the thing itself: env:NAME, file:/path, keychain:service/account, or cmd:… for a password manager. It is resolved at the moment the plugin is called, and never stored here." = "值可以写成引用而不是内容本身：env:名称、file:/路径、keychain:服务/账户，或用 cmd:… 接密码管理器。引用在调用插件的那一刻才解析，不会存进这个文件。";
"Prefer a reference here so the secret stays out of this file." = "这里建议填引用，别把密钥本身留在文件里。";
